<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

	<PropertyGroup>
		<TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
		<ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
		<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<Version>0.8.5</Version>
		<Authors>Codeer</Authors>
		<Company>Codeer</Company>
		<Description>Server-side services for Codeer.LowCode.Blazor apps. Includes AI document analysis (Azure Document Intelligence + Azure OpenAI), mail sending (SMTP / Microsoft Graph / SendGrid / Gmail), file storage (file system / Azure Blob / S3), external logins (Entra ID / Google / AWS Cognito / OIDC), TOTP two-factor authentication, and ASP.NET Core helpers (hot reload, ETag file responses).</Description>
		<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Codeer-Software/Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras</PackageProjectUrl>
		<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Codeer-Software/Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras</RepositoryUrl>
		<RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
		<PackageTags>Blazor;LowCode;Codeer;AI;Mail;Excel;PDF;OpenIdConnect;EntraID</PackageTags>
		<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
		<PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<PackageReleaseNotes>Authentication (Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server.Auth), two additions to the cookie login of the templates.
External logins: sign in with Microsoft Entra ID, Google, AWS Cognito or any OpenID Connect provider. IExternalLoginProvider with EntraLoginProvider / GoogleLoginProvider / CognitoLoginProvider / OidcLoginProvider, each taking its own settings class (the same shape as IMailSender / IFileStorage); the application lists the configured providers in a table (ExternalLoginTable in the templates) and passes them to AddExternalLogins(...). The verified identity is mapped to a user row by the application's IExternalLoginUserResolver, so authorization (user module, UserRead/Write conditions) is unchanged. Includes per-provider validation (Entra UPN / guest rejection / issuer format for multi-tenant, verified e-mail for Google and Cognito, allowed domains), two-step logout that also ends the IdP session, and a one-time ticket flow for native (MAUI) clients that sign in through the system browser. See docs/ExternalLogin.md.
TOTP two-factor authentication (RFC 6238) for the ID/password login: TotpLogin verifies the authenticator code after the password check, enrolls on first login (QR code via QRCoder), keeps the secret in a table named by TotpLoginSettings (no DDL is issued) and rejects reused codes. See docs/TotpLogin.md.
LoginAccountStore: the login-time access to the user table (verify ID/password, resolve an external identity to an account, reject inactive accounts, create the initial administrator). Table and columns come from the current-user module design: IdField, LoginAccountContractField (login ID / external match / active flag / display name) and PasswordHashField (hash / salt, optional for IdP-only apps). Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras 0.8.3.</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<PackageId>Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server</PackageId>
	</PropertyGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<FrameworkReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.App" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<!-- internal のテストのみに許可 (製品アセンブリへの IVT は不可) -->
		<AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleTo">
			<_Parameter1>Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Test</_Parameter1>
		</AssemblyAttribute>
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<ProjectReference Include="..\Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras\Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.csproj" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<!-- メールプレビュー HTML (MailPreviewHtml が埋め込みから読む) -->
		<EmbeddedResource Include="Mail\MailPreview.html" LogicalName="Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras.Server.Mail.MailPreview.html" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<PackageReference Include="Azure.AI.FormRecognizer" Version="4.1.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Azure.AI.OpenAI" Version="2.1.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="AWSSDK.S3" Version="4.0.102.4" />
		<PackageReference Include="Azure.Identity" Version="1.13.2" />
		<PackageReference Include="Azure.Storage.Blobs" Version="12.23.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Excel.Report.PDF" Version="0.36.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="MailKit" Version="4.17.0" />
		<PackageReference Include="Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.OpenIdConnect" Version="8.0.8" />
		<PackageReference Include="System.Text.Encoding.CodePages" Version="8.0.0" />
	</ItemGroup>

	<ItemGroup>
		<None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
		<None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
	</ItemGroup>

</Project>
